Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:06.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relax. It’s Arsenal. We all know how this ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:12.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before a ball was kicked, their runners-up medals had arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same order as usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven’t played a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Beat the rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get me a striker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they bought a striker. Someone to finish the chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Win us a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not the goal! Off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:57.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we’re dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their attacking philosophy? Win a corner. Somebody’s forehead will\Ndo the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.91,0:01:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ONE–NIL! That’s enough football. Everybody back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:30.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lovely. A goalkeeper protecting nine defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Win another corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:40.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody is getting past us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They could defend a one–nil. They couldn’t defend a lead on the\Ntable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He’s only walking. We’re fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,WHY IS HE WALKING?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:08.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long season, Mikel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eyes forward! Nobody look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:16.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still delivering in May?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,NOT NOW!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep hold of the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.55,0:02:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Penalty. Against Arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:34.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For a penalty against Arsenal, please hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mikel! Straight through, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you make that go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:50.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course. Would you like a corner with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:53.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make it two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:59.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello? I’m still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your call is very important to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One goal for the title. And of course, one bloody corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I finally get to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.33,0:03:18.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There’s still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:30.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I’m supposed to be the stri—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:37.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That counts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly as rehearsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:43.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So… who signs for these?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong address.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:48.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting. The season has now ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:10.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I SAID I WAS RETIRED! STOP GIVING ME REASONS TO COME BACK!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.62,0:01:45.12,Result,,0,0,0,,CITY WIN
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.12,0:02:02.12,Result,,0,0,0,,CITY WIN
